val. Omit delivery unless the user asked for another chat; it defaults to the chat where the hook was created. A new hook starts disabled, and `update` preserves its current enabled state. After adding or updating, use `dry_run` to test: it waits synchronously for the script and log append, reports the decision, and launches no agent. Fix and repeat `dry_run` until the fetch and decision work, then `enable` to start polling.",
